  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ResCom: Community resilience in the agrosilvopastoral sector in Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to &#x201C;contribute to developing and strengthening community resilience within agropastoral households, including those of IDPs, in the regions of Boucle du Mouhoun and Nord.&#x201D;. This objective will contribute to the achievement of the following Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs): SDG1 (no poverty), SDG2 (zero hunger), SDG8 (decent employment), SDG10 (reduced inequalities), SDG13 (fight against climate change) , SDG17 (partnership for the global goals).</narrative>
  </description>
